  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\n[F]\n[C]\n[F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]Imagine there's [Cmaj7]no heaven\n[F]\n[C]It's easy if you [Cmaj7]try\n[F]\n[C]No hell [Cmaj7]below us\n[F]\n[C]Above us [Cmaj7]only sky\n[F]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]Imagine all [F/E]the peo-\n[Dm]ple [C]\n[G]Living for today...\n[G7]Ahaah...\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]Imagine there's [Cmaj7]no countries\n[F]\n[C]It isn't hard [Cmaj7]to do\n[F]\n[C]Nothing to kill [Cmaj7]or die\n[F]for\n[C]And no religion, [Cmaj7]too\n[F]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]Imagine [F/E]all the peo-\n[Dm]ple [C]\n[G]Living life in peace...\n[G7]You...\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]You may [G]say I'm a\n[C]dreamer [E7]\n[F]But I'm [G]not the only one\n[C]  [E7]\n[F]I hope [G]someday you'll\n[C]join us [E7]\n[F]And the [G]world will\n[C]be as one\n\n[Verse 3]\n[C]Imagine no [Cmaj7]possessions\n[F]\n[C]I wonder if you [Cmaj7]can\n[F]\n[C]No need for greed [Cmaj7]or hun\n[F]ger\n[C]A brotherhood [Cmaj7]of man\n[F]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]Imagine [F/E]all the peo-\n[Dm]ple [C]\n[G]Sharing all the world...\n[G7]You...\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]You may [G]say I'm a\n[C]dreamer [E7]\n[F]But I'm [G]not the only one\n[C]  [E7]\n[F]I hope [G]someday you'll\n[C]join us [E7]\n[F]And the [G]world will\n[C]live as one",
